    "title": "SCENE I. The Grecian camp.",
    "location": "The Grecian camp.",
    "orderInPlay": 4
  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Ajax and Thersites."
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Thersites!",
          "plainText": "Thersites",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Agamemnon—how if he had boils, full, all over, generally?",
          "plainText": "Agamemnonhow if he had boils full all over generally",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Thersites!",
          "plainText": "Thersites",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-004",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "And those boils did run—say so. Did not the general run then? Were not that a botchy core?",
          "plainText": "And those boils did runsay so Did not the general run then Were not that a botchy core",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-005",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Dog!",
          "plainText": "Dog",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-006",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Then there would come some matter from him;",
          "plainText": "Then there would come some matter from him",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "I see none now.",
          "plainText": "I see none now",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-007",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Thou bitch-wolf's son, canst thou not hear? Feel, then.",
          "plainText": "Thou bitchwolf's son canst thou not hear Feel then",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Strikes him.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-008",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "The plague of Greece upon thee, thou mongrel beef-witted lord!",
          "plainText": "The plague of Greece upon thee thou mongrel beefwitted lord",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-009",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Speak, then, thou unsalted leaven, speak. I will beat thee into handsomeness.",
          "plainText": "Speak then thou unsalted leaven speak I will beat thee into handsomeness",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-010",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I shall sooner rail thee into wit and holiness; but I think thy horse will sooner con an oration than thou learn a prayer without book. Thou canst strike, canst thou? A red murrain o' thy jade's tricks!",
          "plainText": "I shall sooner rail thee into wit and holiness but I think thy horse will sooner con an oration than thou learn a prayer without book Thou canst strike canst thou A red murrain o' thy jade's tricks",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-011",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Toadstool, learn me the proclamation.",
          "plainText": "Toadstool learn me the proclamation",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-012",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Dost thou think I have no sense, thou strikest me thus?",
          "plainText": "Dost thou think I have no sense thou strikest me thus",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-013",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "The proclamation!",
          "plainText": "The proclamation",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-014",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0015",
          "number": 15,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Thou art proclaim'd fool, I think.",
          "plainText": "Thou art proclaim'd fool I think",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-015",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0016",
          "number": 16,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Do not, porpentine, do not; my fingers itch.",
          "plainText": "Do not porpentine do not my fingers itch",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-016",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0017",
          "number": 17,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I would thou didst itch from head to foot and I had the scratching of thee; I would make thee the loathsomest scab in Greece. When thou art forth in the incursions, thou strikest as slow as another.",
          "plainText": "I would thou didst itch from head to foot and I had the scratching of thee I would make thee the loathsomest scab in Greece When thou art forth in the incursions thou strikest as slow as another",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-017",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0018",
          "number": 18,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I say, the proclamation.",
          "plainText": "I say the proclamation",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-018",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0019",
          "number": 19,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Thou grumblest and railest every hour on Achilles; and thou art as full of envy at his greatness as Cerberus is at Proserpina's beauty—ay, that thou bark'st at him.",
          "plainText": "Thou grumblest and railest every hour on Achilles and thou art as full of envy at his greatness as Cerberus is at Proserpina's beautyay that thou bark'st at him",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-019",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0020",
          "number": 20,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Mistress Thersites!",
          "plainText": "Mistress Thersites",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-020",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0021",
          "number": 21,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Thou shouldst strike him.",
          "plainText": "Thou shouldst strike him",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-021",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0022",
          "number": 22,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Cobloaf!",
          "plainText": "Cobloaf",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-022",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0023",
          "number": 23,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "He would pun thee into shivers with his fist, as a sailor breaks a biscuit.",
          "plainText": "He would pun thee into shivers with his fist as a sailor breaks a biscuit",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-023",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0024",
          "number": 24,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "You whoreson cur!",
          "plainText": "You whoreson cur",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-stage-003",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Strikes him.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-024",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0025",
          "number": 25,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Do, do.",
          "plainText": "Do do",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-025",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0026",
          "number": 26,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Thou stool for a witch!",
          "plainText": "Thou stool for a witch",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-026",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0027",
          "number": 27,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Ay, do, do; thou sodden-witted lord! Thou hast no more brain than I have in mine elbows; an asinico may tutor thee. You scurvy valiant ass! Thou art here but to thrash Trojans, and thou art bought and sold among those of any wit like a barbarian slave. If thou use to beat me, I will begin at thy heel and tell what thou art by inches, thou thing of no bowels, thou!",
          "plainText": "Ay do do thou soddenwitted lord Thou hast no more brain than I have in mine elbows an asinico may tutor thee You scurvy valiant ass Thou art here but to thrash Trojans and thou art bought and sold among those of any wit like a barbarian slave If thou use to beat me I will begin at thy heel and tell what thou art by inches thou thing of no bowels thou",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-027",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0028",
          "number": 28,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "You dog!",
          "plainText": "You dog",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-028",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0029",
          "number": 29,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "You scurvy lord!",
          "plainText": "You scurvy lord",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-029",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0030",
          "number": 30,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "You cur!",
          "plainText": "You cur",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-stage-004",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Strikes him.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-030",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0031",
          "number": 31,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Mars his idiot! Do, rudeness; do, camel; do, do.",
          "plainText": "Mars his idiot Do rudeness do camel do do",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-stage-005",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Achilles and Patroclus."
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-031",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0032",
          "number": 32,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Why, how now, Ajax! Wherefore do ye thus?",
          "plainText": "Why how now Ajax Wherefore do ye thus",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0033",
          "number": 33,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "How now, Thersites! What's the matter, man?",
          "plainText": "How now Thersites What's the matter man",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-032",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0034",
          "number": 34,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "You see him there, do you?",
          "plainText": "You see him there do you",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-033",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0035",
          "number": 35,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Ay; what's the matter?",
          "plainText": "Ay what's the matter",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-034",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0036",
          "number": 36,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Nay, look upon him.",
          "plainText": "Nay look upon him",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-035",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0037",
          "number": 37,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "So I do. What's the matter?",
          "plainText": "So I do What's the matter",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-036",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0038",
          "number": 38,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Nay, but regard him well.",
          "plainText": "Nay but regard him well",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-037",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0039",
          "number": 39,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Well! why, so I do.",
          "plainText": "Well why so I do",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-038",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0040",
          "number": 40,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "But yet you look not well upon him; for whosomever you take him to be, he is Ajax.",
          "plainText": "But yet you look not well upon him for whosomever you take him to be he is Ajax",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-039",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0041",
          "number": 41,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I know that, fool.",
          "plainText": "I know that fool",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-040",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0042",
          "number": 42,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Ay, but that fool knows not himself.",
          "plainText": "Ay but that fool knows not himself",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-041",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0043",
          "number": 43,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Therefore I beat thee.",
          "plainText": "Therefore I beat thee",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-042",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0044",
          "number": 44,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Lo, lo, lo, lo, what modicums of wit he utters! His evasions have ears thus long. I have bobb'd his brain more than he has beat my bones. I will buy nine sparrows for a penny, and his pia mater is not worth the ninth part of a sparrow. This lord, Achilles—Ajax, who wears his wit in his belly and his guts in his head—I'll tell you what I say of him.",
          "plainText": "Lo lo lo lo what modicums of wit he utters His evasions have ears thus long I have bobb'd his brain more than he has beat my bones I will buy nine sparrows for a penny and his pia mater is not worth the ninth part of a sparrow This lord AchillesAjax who wears his wit in his belly and his guts in his headI'll tell you what I say of him",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-043",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0045",
          "number": 45,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What?",
          "plainText": "What",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-044",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0046",
          "number": 46,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I say this Ajax—",
          "plainText": "I say this Ajax",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-stage-006",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Ajax offers to strike him.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-045",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0047",
          "number": 47,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Nay, good Ajax.",
          "plainText": "Nay good Ajax",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-046",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0048",
          "number": 48,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Has not so much wit—",
          "plainText": "Has not so much wit",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-047",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0049",
          "number": 49,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Nay, I must hold you.",
          "plainText": "Nay I must hold you",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-048",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0050",
          "number": 50,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "As will stop the eye of Helen's needle, for whom he comes to fight.",
          "plainText": "As will stop the eye of Helen's needle for whom he comes to fight",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-049",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0051",
          "number": 51,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Peace, fool.",
          "plainText": "Peace fool",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-050",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0052",
          "number": 52,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I would have peace and quietness, but the fool will not— he there; that he; look you there.",
          "plainText": "I would have peace and quietness but the fool will not he there that he look you there",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-051",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0053",
          "number": 53,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "O thou damned cur! I shall—",
          "plainText": "O thou damned cur I shall",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-052",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0054",
          "number": 54,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Will you set your wit to a fool's?",
          "plainText": "Will you set your wit to a fool's",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-053",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0055",
          "number": 55,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "No, I warrant you, the fool's will shame it.",
          "plainText": "No I warrant you the fool's will shame it",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-054",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "patroclus",
        "name": "PATROCLUS",
        "displayName": "Patroclus"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0056",
          "number": 56,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Good words, Thersites.",
          "plainText": "Good words Thersites",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-055",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0057",
          "number": 57,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What's the quarrel?",
          "plainText": "What's the quarrel",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-056",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0058",
          "number": 58,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I bade the vile owl go learn me the tenour of the proclamation, and he rails upon me.",
          "plainText": "I bade the vile owl go learn me the tenour of the proclamation and he rails upon me",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-057",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0059",
          "number": 59,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I serve thee not.",
          "plainText": "I serve thee not",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-058",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0060",
          "number": 60,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Well, go to, go to.",
          "plainText": "Well go to go to",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-059",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0061",
          "number": 61,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I serve here voluntary.",
          "plainText": "I serve here voluntary",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-060",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0062",
          "number": 62,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Your last service was suff'rance; 'twas not voluntary. No man is beaten voluntary. Ajax was here the voluntary, and you as under an impress.",
          "plainText": "Your last service was suff'rance 'twas not voluntary No man is beaten voluntary Ajax was here the voluntary and you as under an impress",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-061",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0063",
          "number": 63,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "E'en so; a great deal of your wit too lies in your sinews, or else there be liars. Hector shall have a great catch and knock out either of your brains: a' were as good crack a fusty nut with no kernel.",
          "plainText": "E'en so a great deal of your wit too lies in your sinews or else there be liars Hector shall have a great catch and knock out either of your brains a' were as good crack a fusty nut with no kernel",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-062",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0064",
          "number": 64,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What, with me too, Thersites?",
          "plainText": "What with me too Thersites",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-063",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0065",
          "number": 65,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "There's Ulysses and old Nestor—whose wit was mouldy ere your grandsires had nails on their toes—yoke you like draught oxen, and make you plough up the wars.",
          "plainText": "There's Ulysses and old Nestorwhose wit was mouldy ere your grandsires had nails on their toesyoke you like draught oxen and make you plough up the wars",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-064",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0066",
          "number": 66,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What, what?",
          "plainText": "What what",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-065",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0067",
          "number": 67,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Yes, good sooth. To Achilles, to Ajax, to—",
          "plainText": "Yes good sooth To Achilles to Ajax to",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-066",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0068",
          "number": 68,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I shall cut out your tongue.",
          "plainText": "I shall cut out your tongue",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-067",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0069",
          "number": 69,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "'Tis no matter; I shall speak as much as thou afterwards.",
          "plainText": "'Tis no matter I shall speak as much as thou afterwards",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-068",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "patroclus",
        "name": "PATROCLUS",
        "displayName": "Patroclus"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0070",
          "number": 70,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "No more words, Thersites; peace!",
          "plainText": "No more words Thersites peace",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-069",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0071",
          "number": 71,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I will hold my peace when Achilles' brach bids me, shall I?",
          "plainText": "I will hold my peace when Achilles' brach bids me shall I",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-070",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0072",
          "number": 72,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "There's for you, Patroclus.",
          "plainText": "There's for you Patroclus",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-071",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "thersites",
        "name": "THERSITES",
        "displayName": "Thersites"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0073",
          "number": 73,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I will see you hang'd like clotpoles ere I come any more to your tents. I will keep where there is wit stirring, and leave the faction of fools.",
          "plainText": "I will see you hang'd like clotpoles ere I come any more to your tents I will keep where there is wit stirring and leave the faction of fools",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-stage-007",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exit.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-072",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "patroclus",
        "name": "PATROCLUS",
        "displayName": "Patroclus"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0074",
          "number": 74,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "A good riddance.",
          "plainText": "A good riddance",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-073",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "achilles",
        "name": "ACHILLES",
        "displayName": "Achilles"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0075",
          "number": 75,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Marry, this, sir, is proclaim'd through all our host,",
          "plainText": "Marry this sir is proclaim'd through all our host",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0076",
          "number": 76,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "That Hector, by the fifth hour of the sun,",
          "plainText": "That Hector by the fifth hour of the sun",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0077",
          "number": 77,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Will with a trumpet 'twixt our tents and Troy,",
          "plainText": "Will with a trumpet 'twixt our tents and Troy",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0078",
          "number": 78,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Tomorrow morning, call some knight to arms",
          "plainText": "Tomorrow morning call some knight to arms",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0079",
          "number": 79,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "That hath a stomach; and such a one that dare",
          "plainText": "That hath a stomach and such a one that dare",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0080",
          "number": 80,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Maintain I know not what; 'tis trash. Farewell.",
          "plainText": "Maintain I know not what 'tis trash Farewell",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-speech-074",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "ajax",
        "name": "AJAX",
        "displayName": "Ajax"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "troilus-and-cressida-2-1-line-0081",
          "number": 81,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Farewell. Who shall answer him?",
          "plainText": "Farewell Who shall answer him",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
